      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "The SQL query is valid. Here is the query to count the frequency of prescription according to the dispensed medication units:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    drug_concept_id,\n    quantity,\n    COUNT(*) AS prescription_count\nFROM\n    `drug_exposure`\nWHERE\n    quantity IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY\n    drug_concept_id,\n    quantity\nORDER BY\n    prescription_count DESC, drug_concept_id, quantity;\n```\n\nThis query will return:\n*   `drug_concept_id`: The ID of the dispensed drug.\n*   `quantity`: The amount of the drug dispensed.\n*   `prescription_count`: The number of times that specific drug (identified by `drug_concept_id`) was dispensed with that specific `quantity`.\n\nIt groups by both the drug and the quantity, and then orders the results by the most frequent prescriptions.\n"
          }
        ],
